# How to cite this repository and the site built from it. GitHub shows a
# "Cite this repository" button from this file; Zenodo reads .zenodo.json.
# On each release, update `version` and `date-released` (RELEASING.md), and
# once Zenodo has minted the concept DOI, add it under `identifiers`.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this site, its data or its code, please cite it as below, and
  cite the original publications of the data it draws on (each page lists
  them).
type: software
title: "Nuclear astrophysics: reaction atlas, R-matrix evaluations and reaction rates"
abstract: >-
  Source code and content of Jakub Skowronski's research website: a reaction
  atlas of the nuclear reactions that power stars, with references and
  plain-language explanations (English and Italian); interactive R-matrix
  evaluations run with AZURE2, natively or in the browser; a reaction-rate
  explorer built on JINA REACLIB and pynucastro; a nuclear data explorer of
  EXFOR and ENSDF; a browser demo of WebDAQ, the data acquisition developed
  for LUNA; and notes on R-matrix theory.
authors:
  - family-names: Skowronski
    given-names: Jakub
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-7292-6353"
    affiliation: "Università degli Studi di Padova"
    email: jakub.skowronski@unipd.it
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-10-13"
repository-code: "https://github.com/skowrons94/Website"
keywords:
  - nuclear astrophysics
  - nuclear reactions
  - R-matrix
  - AZURE2
  - reaction rates
  - REACLIB
  - s-process
  - LUNA
  - underground laboratory
  - stellar nucleosynthesis
references:
  - type: article
    title: "AZURE: An R-matrix code for nuclear astrophysics"
    authors:
      - family-names: Azuma
        given-names: R. E.
      - name: "et al."
    journal: Physical Review C
    volume: 81
    start: "045805"
    year: 2010
    doi: 10.1103/PhysRevC.81.045805
  - type: article
    title: "The AME 2020 atomic mass evaluation (II). Tables, graphs and references"
    authors:
      - family-names: Wang
        given-names: M.
      - name: "et al."
    journal: Chinese Physics C
    volume: 45
    start: "030003"
    year: 2021
  - type: article
    title: "The NUBASE2020 evaluation of nuclear physics properties"
    authors:
      - family-names: Kondev
        given-names: F. G.
      - name: "et al."
    journal: Chinese Physics C
    volume: 45
    start: "030001"
    year: 2021
  - type: software
    title: pynucastro
    authors:
      - name: "pynucastro developers"
